{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Antivirus PROTOCOL</strong> is an incremental game about destroying viruses. Learn and adapt, collect data, upgrade yourself, and eliminate the Virus that has taken over the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESTROY VIRUSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/d4b3c0f67d8639bfe0451436c56e5a78.poster.avif?t=1756924023\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/d4b3c0f67d8639bfe0451436c56e5a78.webm?t=1756924023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/d4b3c0f67d8639bfe0451436c56e5a78.mp4?t=1756924023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various code fragments and data from viruses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/f26c3a7d30d48a90453506cb1891e031.poster.avif?t=1756924023\" width=610 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/f26c3a7d30d48a90453506cb1891e031.webm?t=1756924023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/f26c3a7d30d48a90453506cb1891e031.mp4?t=1756924023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the collected data to upgrade yourself and unlock\u00a0powerful new weapons and abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLEAR THE LEVEL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/e966ebc96fe30be32eab4f15bfa44154.poster.avif?t=1756924023\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/e966ebc96fe30be32eab4f15bfa44154.webm?t=1756924023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/e966ebc96fe30be32eab4f15bfa44154.mp4?t=1756924023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the Virus Boss at the end of the level to progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPEAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through levels to unlock new enemies and gather more data.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying Incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple resources to collect</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive upgrade tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide variety of unique weapons and droppable powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, satisfying gameplay</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716650?t=1756924023","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716650?t=1756924023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/7a263ca74af361e014f9bcd3aba2795065a6c004/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756924023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/7a263ca74af361e014f9bcd3aba2795065a6c004/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756924023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3797060,"description":""}],